-- title:
--   Every publication descends from a first publication of its term
-- statement:
--   For all `P`, every cluster `W` with `Inv P W` and every sent publication `W.sent (.publishRequest src s pt pv)`, there is a sent publication `W.sent (.publishRequest src' s' pt' pv')` with `s'.term = s.term`, `pt' < s'.term` and `Descends W s'.term s'.version s.term s.version`. The first publication of a term is the one whose parent is of an older term: the state its publisher had accepted when it won the election.
